#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/architecture.md:1 1c12fb5123e944aba13d34fc840c5fda
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architecture"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/architecture.md:3 5faa948617b44361b8519fd71d37e045
msgid ""
"A Python simulator core feeds CLI, TUI, API, and optional containerized "
"services while retaining an inspectable event trail."
msgstr ""
"Un noyau de simulation Python alimente CLI, TUI, API et services "
"conteneurises optionnels tout en conservant une piste d'evenements "
"inspectable."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/architecture.md:5 44b36d14a25d4e17b3abe9be0d0ee4fd
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "Flux de donnees"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/architecture.md:11
#: 7fe653828cc54af6a17215231bea7633
msgid "Provenance"
msgstr "Provenance"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/architecture.md:13
#: 1c64ca828644417da0fe7fb7b1dfa3e3
msgid ""
"Record the repository commit, configuration, input identifiers, execution "
"command, output location, and validation result. A screenshot alone is not a"
" reproducible artifact."
msgstr ""
"Consignez le commit du depot, la configuration, les identifiants d'entree, "
"la commande d'execution, l'emplacement de sortie et le resultat de "
"validation. Une capture seule n'est pas un artefact reproductible."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/architecture.md:15
#: ddbc76e31cb843669b836bebb8d23dd0
msgid "Failure behavior"
msgstr "Comportement en cas d'echec"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/architecture.md:17
#: 6231363e954b401aafd95351a13d3351
msgid ""
"Missing configuration, unavailable dependencies, invalid input, and failed "
"tests must remain visible. The tool must not replace a failure with invented"
" success."
msgstr ""
"Une configuration absente, des dependances indisponibles, une entree "
"invalide et des tests echoues doivent rester visibles. L'outil ne doit pas "
"remplacer un echec par un succes invente."
